          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Multiple observations by pilots and ground witnesses of a rapid passage of a blue-greenish light phenomenon in eastern France: observation of an atmospheric reentry of a meteoroid.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "f976f83eb856e5d45d4d7529fccef82a0335100796e967e551839abe8d52ff72"
        },
        {
